Z||000005||DaRkLoRD||07-22-2001||01:54 PM||||whattaya mean rain held off???<P>we got one heck of a storm in grand bend, and then at ipperwash it was raining so hard it was painful.. but that's probably cause we were going rather fast on a sea-doo. once we stopped the rain wasn't too bad. we still got completely soaked though.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>thanks again pete & becky.... that was awesome.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>     <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>     <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A><p>[This message has been edited by DaRkLoRD (edited 07-22-2001).]||||reg||14
